  "sublines": [
    "An archaeologist argues Verica, who urged Claudius to invade Britain in AD43, may have been a woman.",
    "A controversial theory could change how we tell the story of the Roman invasion of Britain.",
    "Long cast as a king who begged Rome for help, Verica's sex is now disputed by one archaeologist."
